1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,637
Why does a mosquito

2
00:00:01,677 --> 00:00:02,062
pick you

3
00:00:02,102 --> 00:00:03,626
and ignore your friend?

4
00:00:03,666 --> 00:00:04,977
It isn't luck.

5
00:00:05,017 --> 00:00:06,028
In one lab test,

6
00:00:06,068 --> 00:00:07,517
a single volunteer was

7
00:00:07,557 --> 00:00:09,007
about a hundred times

8
00:00:09,047 --> 00:00:09,858
more attractive

9
00:00:09,898 --> 00:00:12,060
than the least attractive person.

10
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:13,124
Researchers linked it

11
00:00:13,164 --> 00:00:15,326
to fatty acids on the skin.

12
00:00:15,366 --> 00:00:16,815
Bacteria help turn them

13
00:00:16,855 --> 00:00:18,805
into your personal smell.

14
00:00:18,845 --> 00:00:21,145
Then a 2026 study tested

15
00:00:21,185 --> 00:00:22,422
three mosquito species

16
00:00:22,462 --> 00:00:24,411
on one hundred nineteen people.

17
00:00:24,451 --> 00:00:26,613
Nobody attracted all three.

18
00:00:26,653 --> 00:00:27,677
Each species wanted

19
00:00:27,717 --> 00:00:29,241
a different scent.

20
00:00:29,281 --> 00:00:30,517
So being a magnet

21
00:00:30,557 --> 00:00:32,007
depends on which mosquito

22
00:00:32,047 --> 00:00:33,571
is flying tonight.

